## Mission // #003.5

### I Love Gambling

A massive, legendary golden ship docks with the Warm Winds as it idles over Sparr, exciting the crew and drawing massive crowds. It is a casino — within, the Fireteam meet *Dusty*, an NHP-turned-roomba, and are left to their own devices to gamble and participate in any of its myriad silly events. 

This culminates in a plot to reinstate Dusty as the overseer NHP.

Goals

• Have fun

• Make money

• Realize Dusty's dream

Stakes

• Mortgage, or whatever the Fireteam puts all on Red.
• A roomba
